 2022","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/534392/76934534392.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2021","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/534392/69882534392.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2020","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/534392/65595534392.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2019","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/534392/5343920319.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2018","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/534392/5343920318.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2017","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/534392/5343920317.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2016","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/534392/5343920316.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2015","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/534392/5343920315.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2014","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/534392/5343920314.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/534392/5343920313.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2012","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/534392/5343920312.pdf","source":"bse"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Vardhman Special Steels reported strong Q2 FY27 performance with record sales and increased profitability driven by robust demand and operational efficiencies. Management is currently expanding capacity through a new steel plant and a forging facility, with project costs expected to exceed initial estimates. The company is also evaluating a potential suspension of dividends to optimize capital allocation for these projects. Overall, the outlook remains positive with management focusing on capacity utilization and successful project implementation. Vardhman Special Steels Limited reported a strong financial and operational performance for Q2 and H1 FY27, driven by higher sales volumes, improved realizations, and operating efficiencies.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"The company expects sales of approximately 260,000 tons for the year.","quote":"So, we expect sales of about 260,000 tons now for the year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=42d95274-486c-414f-b2c7-3c7feb81ad7f.pdf"},{"claim":"Management maintains an EBITDA guidance range of INR 9,000 to INR 12,000 per ton.","quote":"We still believe the EBITDA range will be between INR9,000 to INR12,000 EBITDA per ton.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=42d95274-486c-414f-b2c7-3c7feb81ad7f.pdf"},{"claim":"The company expects to increase its EBITDA per ton range from 8,000-11,000 to 8,000-12,000 for the next year.","quote":"Today, our range is 8,000 to 11,000. But next year, we should be able to increase the range from 8,000 to 12,000.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=fcaaecec-1feb-41f6-a533-fde1bbded4c7.pdf"},{"claim":"Management targets sales of 255,000 tons for the current year and expects to cross 270,000 tons next year.","quote":"This year we are targeting about 255,000 tons for this year. Next year we expect to cross 270,000.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=fcaaecec-1feb-41f6-a533-fde1bbded4c7.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Demand for the next quarter remains strong.","quote":"So overall, I think the business remains good. The demand for the next quarter is also good","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=42d95274-486c-414f-b2c7-3c7feb81ad7f.pdf"},{"claim":"Management notes that demand from the non-automotive space has increased.","quote":"I also we are getting the feeling that from the non-automotive space also demand has increased, which has started affecting various other of our competitors.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=42d95274-486c-414f-b2c7-3c7feb81ad7f.pdf"},{"claim":"Management noted robust customer demand supporting the strong performance in Q2 FY27.","quote":"“We are pleased to report a strong performance in Q2 FY27, driven by healthy growth in sales volumes, revenue and profitability, supported by robust customer demand, improved realizations and better operating leverage.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ec4555fb-06df-414e-9b9b-29781f20e683.pdf"},{"claim":"Demand is strong, and the company is currently finding it difficult to meet customer requirements.","quote":"Demand scenario is good. We are, in fact, finding it difficult to meet the requirements of the customers.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=fcaaecec-1feb-41f6-a533-fde1bbded4c7.pdf"},{"claim":"The company expects higher steel realizations in Q2 compared to Q1.","quote":"Q2 will be higher prices.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=fcaaecec-1feb-41f6-a533-fde1bbded4c7.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"The new steel plant project is on track for completion by September 2029 with stabilization by March 2030.","quote":"And we are on track as of now to complete the project by September of '29 and stabilization by March of '30.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=42d95274-486c-414f-b2c7-3c7feb81ad7f.pdf"},{"claim":"The forging plant is expected to be commissioned by March 2028.","quote":"The forging plant is expected to come up by March of '28.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=42d95274-486c-414f-b2c7-3c7feb81ad7f.pdf"},{"claim":"The company is expanding its solar plant capacity by 22.5 megawatts.","quote":"And we are now expanding the solar plant by another 22.5 megawatts.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=42d95274-486c-414f-b2c7-3c7feb81ad7f.pdf"},{"claim":"Total project costs for the new steel plant will exceed the previously envisaged INR 2,000 crores.","quote":"But suffice it to say at this point in time that the project cost will be higher than the INR2,000 crores that we had envisaged.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=42d95274-486c-414f-b2c7-3c7feb81ad7f.pdf"},{"claim":"The company has applied for environmental approval to increase melting capacity to 360,000 tons.","quote":"We have applied to the Environment Ministry for approval to increase capacity to 360,000 tons of melting.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=fcaaecec-1feb-41f6-a533-fde1bbded4c7.pdf"},{"claim":"A new NDT line and a new peeling line are scheduled to be commissioned by September or October 2026.","quote":"New NDT line will be commissioned by September, October of this year. And new peeling line will be commissioned by September, October of this year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=fcaaecec-1feb-41f6-a533-fde1bbded4c7.pdf"},{"claim":"The new greenfield steel plant is expected to be commissioned in the financial year 2029-30.","quote":"As of now, we are still on track to commission the project in the financial year '29-'30.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=fcaaecec-1feb-41f6-a533-fde1bbded4c7.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Operational efficiencies from recent capex, including the Kocks Block and reheating furnace, have contributed to cost savings.","quote":"So really, we have started now getting some benefit in terms of cost saving from these capex in the second quarter and going forward it will further increase.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=42d95274-486c-414f-b2c7-3c7feb81ad7f.pdf"},{"claim":"Performance was benefited by lower-cost raw material inventory carried forward from the previous quarter and progressive realization of benefits from last year's capex.","quote":"Our continued focus on cost optimization and operational efficiencies, the benefit of lower-cost raw material inventory carried forward from the previous quarter, and the progressive realization of benefits from last year’s capex on the Kocks Block and reheating furnace contributed to our performance.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ec4555fb-06df-414e-9b9b-29781f20e683.pdf"},{"claim":"EBITDA per ton for the quarter was INR 10,760.","quote":"Overall EBITDA per ton as Sachit has already explained, it's INR10,760 per ton.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=fcaaecec-1feb-41f6-a533-fde1bbded4c7.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"The company has applied to increase its melting capacity from 300,000 tons to 360,000 tons.","quote":"We have applied for increasing the capacity to 360,000 tons.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=42d95274-486c-414f-b2c7-3c7feb81ad7f.pdf"},{"claim":"The new NDT line is scheduled for commissioning in December 2026.","quote":"Our new NDT line will get commissioned by December","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=42d95274-486c-414f-b2c7-3c7feb81ad7f.pdf"},{"claim":"The new peeling line is scheduled for commissioning in early November 2026.","quote":"and the new peeling line will get commissioned by early November.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=42d95274-486c-414f-b2c7-3c7feb81ad7f.pdf"},{"claim":"The company is currently booked out and refusing orders due to capacity constraints.","quote":"We are completely booked out and we are refusing orders.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=fcaaecec-1feb-41f6-a533-fde1bbded4c7.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"Management is examining the suspension of dividends for 3-4 years to fund growth.","quote":"The other thing we are examining, of course, the decision will be taken by the Board, is also to look at examining, suspending the dividend for 3-4 years.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=42d95274-486c-414f-b2c7-3c7feb81ad7f.pdf"},{"claim":"The company is considering a 1:1 debt-equity ratio for the new plant.","quote":"We are now coming around with a conclusion, we are diluting a bit more than required. And therefore, we may look at a 1:1 debt equity.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=42d95274-486c-414f-b2c7-3c7feb81ad7f.pdf"},{"claim":"A rights issue is planned for the second half of the next calendar year.","quote":"For the equity part, we'll be doing a rights issue, which will happen in the later part of next calendar year, second half of next calendar year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=42d95274-486c-414f-b2c7-3c7feb81ad7f.pdf"},{"claim":"The company plans to raise equity capital next year to fund the new plant.","quote":"And second, sometime next year, depending on when we need the funds, we will be doing a capital raising.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=fcaaecec-1feb-41f6-a533-fde1bbded4c7.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"Management identifies project implementation as the primary risk.","quote":"One, there's a project implementation risk. Two, I think that's the biggest risk that we have.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=42d95274-486c-414f-b2c7-3c7feb81ad7f.pdf"},{"claim":"The company faces risks related to metal price inflation and rupee depreciation.","quote":"Metals have gone up everywhere as well as rupee has depreciated.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=fcaaecec-1feb-41f6-a533-fde1bbded4c7.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"The company will finalize the project cost and structure for the new plant by April 2027.","quote":"Everything will be finalized by March, April next year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=42d95274-486c-414f-b2c7-3c7feb81ad7f.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"},{"claim":"The Board will decide on the suspension of dividends in the April 2027 meeting.","quote":"The decision, of course, will be taken by the Board in the April Board meeting.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=42d95274-486c-414f-b2c7-3c7feb81ad7f.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"},{"claim":"The company targets a greenfield plant commissioning by FY30.","quote":"500–600k TPA greenfield plant, commissioning FY30","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ec4555fb-06df-414e-9b9b-29781f20e683.pdf","timeframe":"FY30"},{"claim":"Forging Line 1 commissioning is scheduled for Q3 FY28.","quote":"FORWARD INTEGRATION · commissioning Q3 FY28","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ec4555fb-06df-414e-9b9b-29781f20e683.pdf","timeframe":"Q3 FY28"},{"claim":"The company expects to commission the new NDT and peeling lines.","quote":"New NDT line will be commissioned by September, October of this year. And new peeling line will be commissioned by September, October of this year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=fcaaecec-1feb-41f6-a533-fde1bbded4c7.pdf","timeframe":"H2 FY26"},{"claim":"The company expects to commission the new steel plant.","quote":"As of now, we are still on track to commission the project in the financial year '29-'30.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=fcaaecec-1feb-41f6-a533-fde1bbded4c7.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":3,"kinds":["concall_transcript","concall_ppt"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":35,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":8,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped."}}